                        "text": "Writing an Introduction 2: social sciences and humanities"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "3",
                        "text": "How to write an effective introduction to your work"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "4",
                        "text": "TIP The three-move structure will help you to write your introduction, but there is a great deal of flexibility in the sequence of moves. They may overlap or be performed simultaneously.",
                        "tip": true
                    }
                ]
            },
