                        "text": "Paragraph 1: Introduction"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "7",
                        "text": "Attracts attention to your research and gives background information."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "8",
                        "text": "TIP This is where you start to establish your research territory (Move 1) by attracting the reader's attention (Step 1).",
                        "tip": true
