                        "id": "76",
                        "text": "Paragraph 5"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "77",
                        "text": "Describes the organization of the paper.\n\t\t <br/>Move 3: Occupying the niche\n            <br/>Steps\n            <br/>1. Present your research and state its purpose, aims or objectives.\n            <br/>2. State your research questions or hypotheses.\n            <br/>3. State your theoretical position.\n            <br/>4. Set out the parameters of your research.\n            <br/>5. Describe briefly your methods and participants in survey research.\n            <br/>6. Outline your argument.\n            <br/>7. Give brief details of your findings or a model you propose.\n            <br/>8. Justify your research by showing the significance or contribution of your study.\n            <br/>9. Describe the organization of your dissertation."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "",
                        "text": "TIP This is where you occupy your research niche (Move 3) by, for example, detailing your research aims (Step 1), your research questions (Step 2) and/or your study methods (Step 5), and/or describing the organization of your paper (Step 9).",
                        "tip": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            "notes": {
                "para": []
            },
            "content": {
                "para": [
                    [
