                            "id": "82",
                            "text": " The remainder of the paper is organised as follows. "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "83",
                            "text": " Section 2 reviews "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "82",
                            "text": " the theoretical and empirical literature on gravity models, highlighting evidence on overland trade flows in developing countries. "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "84",
                            "text": " In Section 3, we identify "
